/-!
# Canonical generated-actual origin first germ

This module reads the origin action jet of the actual
already generated by the canonical fixed P506/L0 P286 joint action write.
It does not construct a write from residual support.

At the fixed origin the quadratic connection write preserves the complete
continuum point field, while the action-owned auxiliary recomputation and
connection response close the two P286 equations.  The resulting whole
carrier is reduced to the only two channels which require a first-germ
transport theorem: the scalar and matter momentum divergences.
-/

